  "caption": "Sagesse are Arab champions for the third time, and the first time in 27 years. 🏆\n\n84-75 over Ahli Aleppo in Tuesday night's final at Ghazir, in front of about 4,000 fans. Sagesse led 45-35 at half-time and won all 8 of their games in the tournament.\n\nDeshawndre Washington led the scoring in the final with 23. Ali Mezher was named the tournament's MVP. Their previous Arab titles came in 1998 and 1999.\n\nWho was your player of the tournament? 🇱🇧\n\nSource: Annahar, MTV Lebanon\n@sagesseclubofcl @flb_official\n#SportsWireLB #LebaneseBasketball",
